# MAGIC ## B. Conclusion
# MAGIC
# MAGIC - Three tools bring Databricks into local development: the **CLI** (scripting, CI/CD), **Databricks Connect V2** (remote Spark, debugging), and the **VS Code Extension** (full IDE integration with DAB features).
# MAGIC - Together they let you build, debug, and deploy bundles from your own machine.
